<description>&lt;p&gt;CAR forces have completed Rwanda special forces and basic special operations training, expanding their capabilities, and navy marines and other forces have neutralised 34 Boko Haram and ISWAP fighters in Lake Chad. The CAR military chief held high-level talks with Rwanda Defence Force leadership, discussing cooperation while fresh France-Chad ties were noted. Sudanese Arab refugees fleeing to Chad are encountering hostility and distrust from local populations near the CAR border. The conflict recorded 246 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxPcFlLSHpRcG05Y3VMRHhyR1djMmY1RVlhM3RSejd2WVpZNzhXOWE3M285SGxoeVI1VE1TQ2FtQjY5eXZWVmdiVUZibTVKVFdPWUJ5NlNoeEkxNzk3NEhDaWVKYUt0T2tVSEh5TkVmS0Z0bklKRFdYSWRUa3lnSXkwZmFlZzZWMVBCR1cxcU1oRzdRTjFMR0tIS29GLTJWUkI4RHFndXNpOGlKTFJnSERhOGhmaG40Zw?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxPNVZhT1phU0F3MG9RZXlQVWgxbVpwd0M2UzBXenp3TEtEVzlFWm5VT1BzTkx5MkF4YW9mZW9jSXUzYmhJZE5wLXpaY1gxemUzTlRQeGF0SVhCbWo4N0FLaXVvOEV6eUpRc09TSDM5elBZV3BtZjJGNFpzOGtWRlhVQUhqN1JEVHFDZnFxQVR1eklLZFd2Q1FMUEw0eXdhb2s?oc=5&quot;&gt;People.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMi__?oc=5&quot;&gt;News24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxOa0ZFOXBubU9VXzk0VVZHaTJGQkd4OFVQOEotZkNFNjEybUc0YlVZdlk1YTdoSFNMTXo2WWtWSlBmaWtzNGs0YWE2Ty1RVzdvTVFUdzBqZWRkZU9wekNSVjVrc1dSb0toeWdZcWltclpyQ1BMUGFoZVlObVA3M282eUJsR1ZzTjZwTHRTV21VMjJfRFJpSmNJRzlzVkw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bay News 9&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiAFBVV95cUxNaTFGMmx5Um9kRXVDSlhHSkE5MklrYUgtRlRzOHVtMExET2g1OHNPSVdYVXJUOUozVjB1VnlkbjJNSVIzYjZFSlRHbG5TMEI4SklJTzg4NXpwV0RxS0NvV2pPeWl5UGkxTDJCZlMzUUpFR0p2LUlBU2ZZUlZ6e